WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.430
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:08.500
SCP-963 is not to be given away as a Good
Luck Charm!

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.370
No matter what stressful life events your
colleagues have coming up,

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:17.250
adult dance recitals, weddings, court hearings,
you are not permitted to offer them SCP-963

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.700
for "good luck."

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.170
You of all people know that thing is not good
luck at all.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:26.760
Any and all attempts to convince someone else
to wear the amulet will be treated as hostile

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.900
acts.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:28.900
Stop it.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.969
And to those who feel the need for a little
extra luck: Ignore Dr. Bright.

00:00:32.969 --> 00:00:34.520
The magic was inside you all along.

